",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501268","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["后来我们打听了关于阿星的事，知道了她家里条件不好，父亲进了监狱，母亲的精神也有问题，十几岁起她就要养家。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501269","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["因为她父亲的关系，很多麻烦会不请自来……所以她每天最常做的事情不是打工，就是和人打架。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["旧事勾起曾经的回忆，菲林士多颇为感慨似的笑了笑。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_5/2_5_at_qixingcaifang.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501270","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["电影里的C07总是笑着的，自信又潇洒。<br>但其实最开始的时候，阿星从来不笑。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501271","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["别的演员懂得该入戏时入戏，该抽离角色时就应当及时脱身……但阿星却没有。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501272","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她没有给自己设置那个“抽离角色”的逃脱按钮。<br>一年三百六十五天，她都在扮演C07。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501273","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她学会笑了，但却是像C07那样的笑。<br>她做事更机灵，而非过去那样横冲直撞——但却是像C07那样的“机灵”。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311110.png","audio":"612501274","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["警长先生和那些行为分析科的朋友们，弄错了一件事。<br>阿星并不是混淆了自己和角色。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311110.png","audio":"612501275","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在电影圈摸爬滚打这么多年，我见过不少这样的人。他们错以为自己真是那些他们短暂扮演的、光鲜亮丽的角色，于是忘乎所以。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311110.png","audio":"612501276","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["阿星却恰恰相反，她把C07这个角色看得比自己更加重要。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,167,""]],"type":6,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311110.png","audio":"612501277","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——为此，她不惜抹杀了自我。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_5/2_5_at_qixingcaifang.jpg","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_5/2_5_bg_lvguan.jpg","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501278","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["执夜人小姐，你之前曾经询问过我，那些围绕着我和泰瑞莎以及阿星的传闻是否是真的。现在我可以回答你了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501279","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——是的。它们中的大部分都是真的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"79":{"step":[[79,80,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["菲林士多操控自己的轮椅来到办公桌前，从最下方的抽屉中取出了一只文件袋，将它递给了梁月。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_5/2_5_bg_lvguan.jpg","choice":[]},"80":{"step":[[80,81,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["文件袋颇有分量，里面躺着一本有些老旧的册子，但当梁月试图将它抽出来的时候，先摸到的却是一张同样有些年头了的照片。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_5/2_5_at_xinyishusanjie.jpg","choice":[]},"82":{"step":[[82,83,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311010.png","audio":"612501788","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["这是……？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"83":{"step":[[83,84,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那是一张三人的合照，照片中人的身份呼之欲出。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"84":{"step":[[84,85,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501280","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我们三个那时候小有名气，所以总有很多双眼睛盯着。<br>而人总是经不起用放大镜去看的——每个人都有缺点，我们也不例外。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"85":{"step":[[85,86,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501281","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["阿星太执着，和我一样不懂得妥协。我们两个产生分歧的时候，总是弄得惊天动地，让夹在中间的泰瑞莎很是难做。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"86":{"step":[[86,87,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501282","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["那个时候的我也是一样，只懂得朝着锚定的方向一个劲走，却不懂得、也不屑于停下来看看四周。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"87":{"step":[[87,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501283","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["泰瑞莎则是性格太好了。<br>别人说什么她都照单全收，憋在心里，最后把自己划得伤痕累累。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"88":{"step":[[88,89,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["菲林士多望着照片上三人的笑脸，自己脸上的笑容却掺了几分感慨和一丝微不可察的伤感。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"89":{"step":[[89,90,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501284","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["泰瑞莎不喜欢拍照。她总是对自己的外貌没有自信，所以我们的合照也没有几张。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"90":{"step":[[90,91,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311101.png","audio":"612501285","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["这是在C07第二部拍摄期间拍的，那几乎是我们最好的时候。<br>虽然没有想过能够永远并肩，但我们也没有考虑过要在什么时候分道扬镳。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"91":{"step":[[91,92,""]],"type":1,"name":["菲林士多","","Noire","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311111.png","audio":"612501286","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["——可那些我们各自怀抱的缺陷，却在看不到的地方制造了无数龟裂。<br>等我们察觉到的时候，已经无法挽回了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"92":{"step":[[92,93,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_5/2_5_bg_pianchang.jpg","choice":[]},"93":{"step":[[93,94,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon"